ed2c6dc2f5731e179a028467cd147.poster.avif?t=1740147640\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130960/extras/812ed2c6dc2f5731e179a028467cd147.webm?t=1740147640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130960/extras/812ed2c6dc2f5731e179a028467cd147.mp4?t=1740147640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There are no rules in the race for first place! Shoot with a gun, hit with a stick, use a whip, or throw a rope with stones to slow down your rivals. Show tactical skill and cunning to overtake everyone and cross the finish line first. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130960/extras/24934cdf356c8677321287df580857bd.webp?t=1740147640\" width=616 height=25 /></span><br><strong>Express your unique style through customization</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130960/extras/0b62289f1732339c4d235d648853adcd.poster.avif?t=1740147640\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130960/extras/0b62289f1732339c4d235d648853adcd.webm?t=1740147640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130960/extras/0b62289f1732339c4d235d648853adcd.mp4?t=1740147640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make your character stand out with extensive customization options. Choose from a variety of outfits and accessories for yourself and your bird to shine on the track and emphasize your individuality. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130960/extras/24934cdf356c8677321287df580857bd.webp?t=1740147640\" width=